y": "Thank you very much for your support. I am a fan of your illustrations and your Western-style drawings. I would love to see \"Professor Wingston\" and \"Assistant Lavery,\" two of your original characters, and would like to send a request to ......!\n\nProfessor Wingston.\nAbout 50's in appearance. Small build.\nProfessor of the discipline of magical engineering. He owns a cat named Miss Little White. Lazy, fast-paced, mischievous personality. She has many secrets that she cannot share with others.\n\n◆Ravely, his assistant.\nHe is 23 years old. He is an intellectual type karakuri geek with a solid physique. He also loves to solve mysteries. He is honored and respected to be an assistant of a famous professor, but he is usually pushed around by the professor who has his own pace.\n\nI don't have a lot of material on clothing, so if there is anything you don't understand, you are free to arrange it however you like! (For reference, the image is from ......1920s British menswear)\nOther materials are included in the attached URL. Thank you very much for your consideration. ......\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1_s9UpIP8iCuo6p34oLcvhQSCcMVp-GAB", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@neoji__/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1691711, "client_id": 540626, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7f64a7d3/uploads/origins/0425892e-7b19-4bf9-84fb-195fc45bba0f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7cd68b70e9406c7d756042bbf2d19d8d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7f64a7d3/uploads/origins/0425892e-7b19-4bf9-84fb-195fc45bba0f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7cd68b70e9406c7d756042bbf2d19d8d, https://si.imgix.net/7f64a7d3/uploads/origins/0425892e-7b19-4bf9-84fb-195fc45bba0f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=758db0ca99ffa2b61564638de42800e0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7f64a7d3/uploads/origins/0425892e-7b19-4bf9-84fb-195fc45bba0f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eaae258d07cfeb15ce7302e3f32c5fb1 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7f64a7d3/uploads/origins/0425892e-7b19-4bf9-84fb-195fc45bba0f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c3848d1c6d7382ba5a6afb620662f75b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7f64a7d3/uploads/origins/0425892e-7b19-4bf9-84fb-195fc45bba0f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c3848d1c6d7382ba5a6afb620662f75b, https://si.imgix.net/7f64a7d3/uploads/origins/0425892e-7b19-4bf9-84fb-195fc45bba0f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=36240d133bb6384e86878a10e45e15a5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7f64a7d3/uploads/origins/0425892e-7b19-4bf9-84fb-195fc45bba0f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=07baebd81c06a808fbd4d12956e409ef 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I'm Komori, and I've always been a fan of your work on Twitter.\n I really love your illustrations and have been looking forward to your reopening...!\n I would like to ask you to draw the following characters.\n\nName: Ain (male)\nHeight: 185cm\nRemarks: He is not a womanizer, but a playful person. He is a germophobe. Always wears gloves. He is a dexterous and perfect person. He has a sister and is extremely sissy-conscience.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/comori22/status/1571799829906624512?s=46&t=jUr_qIqbYm2OkTvx6QliXw\n\nhttps://twitter.com/comori22/status/1571450759769890816?s=46&t=jUr_qIqbYm2OkTvx6QliXw\n\nhttps://twitter.com/comori22/status/1594310570785722368?s=46&t=jUr_qIqbYm2OkTvx6QliXw\n\nIf you accept, I'd like to leave all the clothing, composition, etc. to you! I would be happy if you could draw Ein as you like.\nI know you are busy, but if you are available, I would be very happy to work with you. 🙇♀️\n\nAimori", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@neoji__/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1691711, "client_id": 1699615, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2e8ff539/uploads/origins/07740441-8c00-4b1e-9a30-4fdc7324f7c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=565e434f0820652bd1fed071df1c8538", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2e8ff539/uploads/origins/07740441-8c00-4b1e-9a30-4fdc7324f7c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=565e434f0820652bd1fed071df1c8538, https://si.imgix.net/2e8ff539/uploads/origins/07740441-8c00-4b1e-9a30-4fdc7324f7c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bcb83b6efe86c5a9c9537605a64ea6b8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2e8ff539/uploads/origins/07740441-8c00-4b1e-9a30-4fdc7324f7c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d0278fdf97335b6ce0cd64a8f474b3a0 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2e8ff539/uploads/origins/07740441-8c00-4b1e-9a30-4fdc7324f7c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2806331410288bc00d0c2963ad392c36", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2e8ff539/uploads/origins/07740441-8c00-4b1e-9a30-4fdc7324f7c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2806331410288bc00d0c2963ad392c36, https://si.imgix.net/2e8ff539/uploads/origins/07740441-8c00-4b1e-9a30-4fdc7324f7c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fff5332ebbfde44a4854c8b2bde6dff8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2e8ff539/uploads/origins/07740441-8c00-4b1e-9a30-4fdc7324f7c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a59b55b7f1318b7cc71e1c11497905ec 3x"}, "body": "Hi! I really like your depiction of the picture, can I ask you to draw my original characters?\n\nH (black hair): Age 35. He's the sexy and elegant type, thin and somewhat feminine in appearance. He used to be an aristocrat, sometimes a little tsundere.\nC (red hair): Age 24. He was a young leader, decisive but gentle, with drooping eyes and long eyelashes.\nC is pursuing H, and H hasn't responded to C's confession, but their relationship is gradually warming up in their daily interactions.\n\nIf possible, hope they go on a car trip together, like in a road movie. Clothes and such are all up to you, please draw freely.\n\nIf you feel something inappropriate about this request, please feel free to cancel it, thank you very much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1bAnIjoEIkKzwW5De-ftqMfPR1Bwmu58d?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@neoji__/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1691711, "client_id": 96215, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8de3e2a1/uploads/origins/1034a82d-648e-41e2-8410-32604c5e460d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0d982bcf5e4d449b808b788c29f6cf93", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8de3e2a1/uploads/origins/1034a82d-648e-41e2-8410-32604c5e460d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0d982bcf5e4d449b808b788c29f6cf93, https://si.imgix.net/8de3e2a1/uploads/origins/1034a82d-648e-41e2-8410-32604c5e460d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b5201e2d2b7d8d7ed76e7159e4701906 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8de3e2a1/uploads/origins/1034a82d-648e-41e2-8410-32604c5e460d?bg=%23fff&auto=forma